5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to know which past projects actually satisfied the people using them.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about how long rooms stay out of service during construction and how they are used afterward.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I worry about the people doing the daily work. Who is left to maintain these spaces after the project ends?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I am worried about the calendar. Every project seems to hit an unpriced snag, squeezing a year of work into the remaining weeks.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I am curious about the gap between the approved budget and the actual cost once the doors open.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Benjamin, that gap is real. I am checking the post-occupancy reviews to see if the satisfaction matches the spending.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, your calendar concern is valid. I am checking the timetable records to see how long rooms actually stay out of service.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Mizuki, the calendar squeezes the people too. I am checking the staffing posts to see who is left to do the work.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@George, the squeeze hits the staff hardest. I am checking the delivery schedules to see where the delays actually start.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
