15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will also check the survey findings in the older blocks. The condition of the existing structure often dictates the final outcome.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will also check the booking data for specialist and general rooms. Usage patterns reveal if the space is actually needed.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will also check the bench technicians' weekly manual routines. The daily grind reveals the true burden on the remaining staff.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will also check the weather days in the site diaries. Unpriced delays often start with rain nobody accounted for.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I will also check the tender records. If the bids were low, the market is about to correct the committee’s optimism.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Let us see what the records say.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
