51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I am waiting for the candidates. The data suggests we should prioritize general rooms to reduce off-site hiring costs.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,I am waiting for the candidates. The data is clear: we must not add work to the exhausted technicians.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
